e, geography and method where relevant.</li>\n\n\n<li>We note material limitations and avoid treating one study as proof of a wider trend.</li>\n\n\n<li>We always link to the original report.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Coming next: a searchable repository by theme, organisation, year and geography. <a href=\"/submit/\">Submit research</a> · <a href=\"/category/research/\">All research</a></p>\n\n\n",
